> > +	}
> > +	if (decap_enable == fs->decap_enabled)
> > +		return 0;
> 
> An llm is complaining that fs->decap_enabled is not set to false when
> the decap table is destroyed with accel_psp_fs_rx_decap_ft_destroy(),
