Date: Tue, 4 Aug 2026 11:45:53 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] KVM: arm64: CCA: Reuse early vGIC sysreg emulation for Realm
 exits

Realm vGIC CPU interface sysreg exits currently bypass KVM's early vGIC
